# \psi_{n-1} \phi_1 \\
# \vdots \\
# \psi_{n-1} \phi_{m-1}
# \end{bmatrix}
# \end{equation}
# $$
#
# The tensor product of two quantum states is a quantum state with a size of $n \times m$.
